    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, what? \"Goblin-run taverns\" and \"secret caves\"? I'm not sure I follow. I'm just trying to troubleshoot a production issue for a client. Can you please drop the metaphors and just tell me the actual technical process? Is this a TTL issue or something else?",
      "source": "evaluator"
